sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant A as App
  participant M as LLM
  participant T as Tool
  U->>A: Question
  A->>M: Messages plus tool schemas
  M-->>A: Tool call with arguments
  A->>A: Validate arguments
  A->>T: Execute tool
  T-->>A: Result
  A->>M: Tool result
  M-->>A: Final answer
  A-->>U: Answer
